    "Question #: 4": {
      "Title": "Exam E20-507 topic 1 question 17 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A VMAX3 array has been configured with two Storage Resource Pools (SRP). Source volumes are assigned to SRP_1 and target volumes are assigned to"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "SRP_2. A TimeFinder SnapVX snapshot of the source volumes is linked to the target volumes in the default mode."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What will happen when there are new host writes to the source volumes?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Snapshot deltas will be stored in SRP_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Snapshot deltas will be stored in SRP_2"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Snapshot deltas will be stored in the Reserved Capacity of SRP_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Snapshot deltas will be stored in the Reserved Capacity of SRP_2"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: B \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
